只取事先写明的发票地址，并且不跟随重定向：

```java
static final java.util.Set<String> ALLOWED = java.util.Set.of(
    "https://files.example/invoices/sample.pdf");

static byte[] fetchInvoice(String url) throws Exception {
  if (!ALLOWED.contains(url)) {
    throw new IllegalArgumentException("url");
  }
  java.net.http.HttpClient client = java.net.http.HttpClient.newBuilder()
      .followRedirects(java.net.http.HttpClient.Redirect.NEVER)
      .build();
  java.net.http.HttpRequest request = java.net.http.HttpRequest.newBuilder(java.net.URI.create(url)).build();
  return client.send(request, java.net.http.HttpResponse.BodyHandlers.ofByteArray()).body();
}
```
